{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fd18430a-3cd7-8292-9ce5-5e26982545aa",
  "created_at": "2026-02-19T10:39:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gerard Quinn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:36:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:37:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, I'd like to report a clogged catch basin at the corner by 257 Malbone Road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:37:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 257 Malbone Road, that's in the North End. Tell me what you're seeing there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:37:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The basin on the corner is packed with leaves. It's been that way about a week. There's a puddle sitting at it and it never drains."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:37:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the grate is covered with leaves and the water just sits there. Has it rained recently, or is this dry weather?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:37:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it's dry. No storm. The water just doesn't go anywhere because the basin is blocked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:37:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Dry weather, leaves blocking the basin, standing water at the corner of Malbone. Is the water out in the road or does it reach the sidewalk too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:37:54-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It spreads across the edge of the road and into the gutter line. My neighbor is older and she can't get out through it. She won't step across that wet stretch, and there's no other way to the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:38:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's helpful to know. I'll note that there's an older neighbor who's having trouble getting out because of it. Does it freeze overnight there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:38:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little in the mornings, yes. It's slick by the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:38:24-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll put that in too. Let me read it back. Clogged catch basin with leaves at the corner by 257 Malbone Road, about a week, standing water that isn't draining, icy in the mornings, and an elderly neighbor can't get past it. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:38:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:38:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And can I get a number to reach you at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:38:49-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0151."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:38:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0151, and it's Mr. Quinn?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:38:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gerard Quinn, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:38:55-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could you have someone call me when it's cleared? I'd like to know it's done. I'm home most of the day, I'm putting off a haircut to save a few dollars, so I'm not going anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:39:09-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll mark it for a call back once the crew finishes. It goes out to the drainage crew today, and they work through the list as they can, so it may be a day or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:39:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:39:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Quinn. Thanks for calling it in. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:39:31-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye."
    }
  ],
